OL,4,CWorld's second oldest football club    
OL,5,Cquits league                           
OL,6,GThe world's second oldest football     
OL,7,Gclub has withdrawn from the league it  
OL,8,Gcompetes in after warning it could run 
OL,9,Gout of money by December.              
OL,11,FSheffield outfit Hallam FC said it     
OL,12,Fwould resign from the Northern Premier 
OL,13,FLeague East - the seventh tier of      
OL,14,FEnglish football - with immediate      
OL,15,Feffect.                                
OL,17,F"In making this agonising decision we  
OL,18,Fare trying to do the right thing by    
OL,19,Fthe club, the players, our suppliers   
OL,20,Fand the community," a statement issued 
OL,21,Fon Wednesday read.                     
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
