OL,4,CKing's head forester supports 10,000-  
OL,5,Ctree project                           
OL,6,GWhen King Charles III visited Grimsby  
OL,7,Gin June, he promised to help with a    
OL,8,Gproject to plant 10,000 trees.         
OL,10,FOn Thursday, the King's head forester  
OL,11,FGeraint Richards arrived in the town   
OL,12,Fto help community interest company All 
OL,13,FThings Good and Nice with its bid to   
OL,14,Fplant thousands of trees in Grimsby,   
OL,15,FCleethorpes and Immingham.             
OL,17,FRichards said: "The King phoned me on  
OL,18,Fthe morning he came to Grimsby and saw 
OL,19,Fabout this ambition to plant 10,000    
OL,20,Ftrees and sent me on a mission.        
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
