OL,4,CTakeaway owner 'shaken' by egg and     
OL,5,Cstone attacks                          
OL,6,GYoung people throwing eggs and stones  
OL,7,Gin repeated attacks on a Chinese       
OL,8,Gtakeaway have left its owner "shaken". 
OL,10,FVivian, owner of Dragon House on       
OL,11,FFoxwood Lane in York, posted images on 
OL,12,FFacebook showing the aftermath of the  
OL,13,Fattacks, including a carton of broken  
OL,14,Feggs discarded on the ground and the   
OL,15,Ftakeaway's smeared windows.            
OL,17,FIn her message, she said: "I just want 
OL,18,Fto open the shop tomorrow and feel     
OL,19,Fsafe doing the job I love. It's a      
OL,20,Fhorrible feeling to stand behind your  
OL,21,Fown counter and wonder if it's going   
OL,22,Fto happen again."                 G4/4 
